  unitName: Lord Heinrich (EU)
  unitId: 710143
  unitNumber: 7060
  description: Lord Heinrich of The Crimson Fort, despite being one himself, hates
    his Shapeshifter form. He scorns his entire race, the Noblesses who used their
    powers to enslave the entire world. In his youth he married Lady Jade of the
    Green Forest, but on his wedding night he discovered her dark side when she tried
    to behead him...
  summonDesc: Nice to meet you summoner! Let's hunt together...
  fusionDesc: You made me stronger today. Beautiful is the Moon... for a hunt.
